527: #  block to 2026-09-27 by owner ruling.)
528: #
529: #  THE SELFTEST RUNS ONLY WHEN THE CHECKER ITSELF CHANGES.  --selftest applies its mutants (22, pinned below) to
530: #  temp copies and asserts each exit status, which takes ~14 s -- too slow for every commit,
531: #  and pointless when the checker did not move.  Firing it on the one commit that could break
532: #  it is the section-E idea: a check nobody has to remember.
533: say ""; say "R. every committed detector is run by a gate (or dated-exempt)"
534: PWCHK=$_HERE/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py
