9: 
10: `#550` re-dated the ten 2026-09-27 probe-wiring exemptions ONE BY ONE (owner ruling 2026-09-24) so that no single day
11: turns every commit red again -- the `wiringcliff` shape.  **Nothing checks that property.**  `check_probe_wiring.py`
12: accepts any number of entries on one date, and gate 2's `SC_EXEMPT` / `SM_EXEMPT` and `gate_asan_sweep.sh`'s
