23: "WHY THESE FIFTEEN" and "All fifteen were MEASURED", while the table holds TWELVE entries -- three hpcmips subtypes were
24: discharged by `#444`, and the same block records that discharge.  Some of the "fifteen" mentions are HISTORY (what one
25: run touched; "fifteen deaths" in a dated measurement) and stay; the ones stated as the table's present size are wrong
