1: # `#550` (exemptredate): the ten probe-wiring exemptions that all fell due on 2026-09-27 re-dated one by one, each to its own owed-work date and reason, by owner ruling -- and gate 2's two self-check exemptions decided separately
2: 
3: **The obligation.**  `tools/pipeline/check_probe_wiring.py`'s `EXEMPT` table held ten ungated detectors on ONE date,
