7: `SC_EXEMPT` held its two entries on the same date; **owner ruling 2026-09-25 (row `scexempt`): `ieee_store` is
8: re-dated, `wdc_identify` is FIXED instead** -- that is `#551`.  **No emulator code changes.**
9: 
