20:   written beside it: `ieee_store` re-dated with its reason standing (nine counters and no comparator -- the larger
21:   refactor, dated after the wdc work); `wdc_identify` NOT re-dated, because `#551` fixes it.
22: * `tools/precommit_check.sh` -- one comment: the exemption block's history now names the dispersal.
